---
[v2] pcie: mediatek-gen3: Add PCIe IRQ affinity support

Add PCIe IRQ affinity support for MediaTek Gen3 PCIe controller. This feature
introduces MSI group management and IRQ affinity control, allowing MSI interrupts
to be distributed across different groups and bound to specific CPUs for improved
performance and load balancing.
---
v2: Update quilt refresh to re-sync the patch and ensure it applies cleanly
    with the latest source code.
